# One dola.com account cookie per line (must include sessionid=)
# How to obtain: Log into https://www.dola.com -> F12 -> Network -> any request -> Headers -> Cookie
# Lines starting with # are comments. Example (placeholder, replace with real cookie):
# sessionid=xxxx; msToken=xxxx; s_v_web_id=ver_xxxx; sid_guard=xxxx; passport_auth_status=xxxx
#
# The dashboard "+ Add Cookie" panel also accepts pasted browser exports directly:
#   - JSON array  (Cookie-Editor / EditThisCookie export)
#   - Netscape cookie file  (curl / Cookies.txt format)
#   - header string  (k=v; k2=v2 from DevTools -> Copy -> Copy as cURL / Cookie)
#
# Validation is lenient: only sessionid is strictly required. msToken and
# s_v_web_id are optional (warnings only) — the runtime treats msToken as
# optional and continues if it is missing.